msgid ""
"The overall signing benchmark values below are from a parity-gated "
"`1.0.0rc1` local CPU reference run. They are not network latency or "
"exchange throughput. See the detailed "
"[benchmarks/README.md](https://github.com/owlyfi/async-"
"hyperliquid/blob/main/benchmarks/README.md) manual for the full "
"methodology, parity gate, and per-operation results."
